WEBVTT

00:04:29.181 --> 00:04:33.019
I've heard people say that being
a guardian has changed their lives.

00:04:33.519 --> 00:04:35.271
I think of the young Jarett Quock,

00:04:35.313 --> 00:04:37.356
a young man from the Tahltan First Nation

00:04:37.356 --> 00:04:39.859
in what is now known as British Columbia.

00:04:39.859 --> 00:04:42.069
Jarett used to be
a heavy-equipment operator

00:04:42.069 --> 00:04:44.905
working on job sites
far from his community.

00:04:45.281 --> 00:04:47.867
He faced racism
from non-Indigenous peoples

00:04:47.867 --> 00:04:50.119
and non-unrelated,

00:04:50.161 --> 00:04:52.621
unfortunately, he struggled
with addictions.

00:04:52.663 --> 00:04:55.666
So when a job opened up
with a Tahltan Wildlife Guardians,

00:04:55.666 --> 00:04:57.001
he decided to take it.

00:04:57.501 --> 00:04:58.919
He said,

00:04:58.919 --> 00:05:02.798
"Being a guardian helped get me
through the tough times in my life.